{
	"info": {
		"name": "07 · RBAC negatives",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"description": "The denial surface — every request that should be refused, and why. Two identities: seeded **admin** (owner) and seeded **viewer** (a low-privilege authenticated user).\n\n**Flow.** A) **401** — unauthenticated reads; B) **403** — `viewer` is authenticated but lacks the permission (`users:read` / `models:read` / `evaluation_groups:create`); C) **404** — `viewer` can't see admin's `invitation_only` group (invisible, not 403 — no existence leak); D) break-glass — admin sees and edits the same group.\n\n**Auth model.** Per-request: `{{admin_token}}` (owner) / `{{viewer_token}}` (insufficient) / `noauth`. Self-contained — **no manual token** (uses the seeded `viewer` instead of a provisioned outsider), no `00-bootstrap`.\n\n**Leftovers.** The private evaluation group leaks (no group DELETE; `run_suffix`-unique). The seeded viewer is left intact.\n\n**Verified:** 16/16 checks green end-to-end against a live stack (`make up` + `make seedlocal`)."
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "noauth"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:8000"
		},
		{
			"key": "run_suffix",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "admin_token",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "viewer_email",
			"value": "viewer@test.com"
		},
		{
			"key": "viewer_password",
			"value": "password123"
		},
		{
			"key": "viewer_token",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "o7_private_group_id",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "o7_model_id",
			"value": ""
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Setup",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1 · Log in as admin",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
